OL,3,GNEWSA'Our market is the jewel in the
OL,4,Acrown of the town'
OL,5,
OL,6,FTraders in Clitheroe have described the
OL,7,Ftown's market as the "jewel in the
OL,8,Fcrown" and a "bustling" community hub
OL,9,Fas the council unveiled plans to
OL,10,Fimprove the area.
OL,12,FRibble Valley Borough Council wants to
OL,13,Frevamp the "bullring" area, where it
OL,14,Fpreviously spent #250,000 renovating
OL,15,Fthe markets' casual stalls and
OL,16,Fupgrading surfaces and lighting.
OL,18,FIt also plans to bring in permanent
OL,19,Fcabins on Back King Street and tidy up
OL,20,Fthe bins.
OL,23,APub: 28-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,403,400,260,160,0,100
