OL,3,GNEWSA'Our market is the jewel in the
OL,4,Acrown of the town'
OL,5,
OL,6,FDavid Bolton, of D Bolton and Sons
OL,7,FButchers and Cheesemongers, said: "Why
OL,8,Fhave more cabins at the back? They're
OL,9,Funnecessary, plus that is where market
OL,10,Ftraders park their cars. Where do they
OL,11,Fpark otherwise?"
